WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:19.390
The left menu is now about the project that is open. Under Inbox and Configure agents, a section called Project names it, here Checkout, and lists its views: Canvas, Table, Queue, Parked and Archive. The list of every project is gone; the project name in the bar and Command P still switch projects.

00:00:20.343 --> 00:00:30.463
The rules every agent follows moved out of Preferences into Configure agents, Rules. They open in a dialog of their own, where a rule is added or removed as before.

00:00:32.614 --> 00:00:42.974
Below the project comes Configure. Appearance slides in within the menu, in place of the large Preferences dialog: light or dark, and motion, each taking effect at once.

00:00:45.897 --> 00:00:53.377
Settings opens the configuration as before. About Seismic, left over from Preferences, is now its last section.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:01:03.500
Under a thin line follow Controls: mouse and keys, with a question mark, and Give Feedback, with a heart in a speech bubble, which used to read Report a wish or a bug.

00:01:04.451 --> 00:01:15.691
In a narrow window the same menu drops down under the menu button. On the phone, its menu takes the same shape: the project with its queue and parked cards, and Configure with Appearance.

00:01:16.645 --> 00:01:26.085
In short: the menu shows the open project and its views, then Configure, and Preferences is gone, its parts now under Configure agents, Appearance and Settings.
